@startuml
title ZML Backend — Runtime Flow

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Desktop" as ElectronUI {
  component "UI" as UI
}

rectangle "Backend Backend" as Backend {
  component "HTTP API / WS API" as API
  component "Read API\nread-only SQLite" as ReadAPI

  queue "RuntimeInputQueue\nsignals + commands" as RuntimeInputQueue
  component "InputCoordinator\nsingle-threaded dispatcher" as InputCoordinator
  component "MiningCoordinator" as MiningCoordinator

  component "LatestPositionService\nephemeral state" as LatestPositionService

  rectangle "Sub-services" as SubServices {
    component "LootAccumulator" as LootAccumulator
    component "MiningSetupService" as MiningSetupService
    component "CostTracker" as CostTracker
    component "ClaimLifecycle" as ClaimLifecycle
    component "SegmentLifecycle" as SegmentLifecycle
    component "RunLifecycle" as RunLifecycle
    component "DropCorrelator" as DropCorrelator
  }

  component "Domain Events" as DomainEvents
  queue "EventQueue" as EventQueue
  component "DbWriter" as DbWriter

  database "SQLite Event Store\n+ Projections" as SQLite
  component "PersistedEventBus\n/ UI updates" as PersistedEventBus
}

rectangle "Local input adapters" as LocalInputs {
  component "Finder OCR Signal" as FinderSignal
  component "Deed OCR Signal" as DeedSignal
  component "Chat Signal" as ChatSignal
  component "Compass / Position Reading" as PositionReading
}

UI --> API : commands\nstart/stop/run setup
API --> RuntimeInputQueue : runtime commands

FinderSignal --> RuntimeInputQueue
DeedSignal --> RuntimeInputQueue
ChatSignal --> RuntimeInputQueue

PositionReading --> LatestPositionService

RuntimeInputQueue --> InputCoordinator
InputCoordinator --> MiningCoordinator

MiningCoordinator --> LootAccumulator : signal/context
MiningCoordinator --> MiningSetupService : signal/context
MiningCoordinator --> CostTracker : signal/context
MiningCoordinator --> ClaimLifecycle : signal/context
MiningCoordinator --> SegmentLifecycle : signal/context
MiningCoordinator --> RunLifecycle : command/context
MiningCoordinator --> DropCorrelator : signal/context

LootAccumulator --> MiningCoordinator : events
MiningSetupService --> MiningCoordinator : events/setup snapshot
CostTracker --> MiningCoordinator : events
ClaimLifecycle --> MiningCoordinator : events
SegmentLifecycle --> MiningCoordinator : events
RunLifecycle --> MiningCoordinator : events
DropCorrelator --> MiningCoordinator : events

LatestPositionService ..> DropCorrelator : fresh position snapshot

MiningCoordinator --> DomainEvents : publishes collected events
DomainEvents --> EventQueue
EventQueue --> DbWriter
DbWriter --> SQLite : persist events\nupdate projections
DbWriter --> PersistedEventBus : persisted event notifications

UI --> ReadAPI : read dashboard/runs/claims/stats
ReadAPI --> SQLite : read-only queries
SQLite --> ReadAPI
ReadAPI --> UI : DTOs / projections

PersistedEventBus --> UI : live updates

note right of RuntimeInputQueue
Contains normalized inputs:
- OCR/chat/deed signals
- API commands
end note

note bottom of LatestPositionService
Compass position is latest-state telemetry.
It is not persisted as a position stream.
Mining events may attach a fresh snapshot.
end note

note bottom of MiningCoordinator
Sub-services return events to MiningCoordinator.
Only MiningCoordinator publishes domain events.
end note

@enduml